[# email/desktop-only: sections that are hidden on phones (below 480px wide).

   Uses the hide-mobile class from layouts/base.mjml. Clients that ignore media queries (Outlook desktop, Gmail on
   non-Google accounts) show it always, which is the safe default for a desktop-only block.

   Compatibility
   - Outlook desktop: always shown (no media queries).
   - Gmail apps: hidden on phones. Gmail on non-Google accounts drops media queries and shows it on phones too.
   - Dark mode: nothing extra, the sections inside carry their own colors. #]
<mj-wrapper css-class="hide-mobile" padding="0">
  [[ data.content ]]
</mj-wrapper>
